{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-remote-ssh#card-zh","repo":"173787247/dsh-remote-ssh","commit":"d7d1891ac86d59fad51ddeb0c4abf83f7468b4b3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-ssh-run 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的远程主机插件，通过 SSH 将已配置的 Unix、IBM AIX、macOS 或 Linux 主机接入 DSH。插件注册主机状态、单命令执行和系统探测工具，可列出主机、运行 uname 探测、按主机系统选择只读探测命令，并执行配置白名单内的 argv。命令以参数数组传递，不经 shell；需先在 profile 中配置主机和允许的命令。适合需要从 DSH 查看或管理远程 Unix 系统信息的用户，连接凭据由本机 SSH 配置提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-3","index.js:22-32","index.js:56-67","index.js:90-103","lib/ssh.js:59-69"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-remote-ssh#card-en","repo":"173787247/dsh-remote-ssh","commit":"d7d1891ac86d59fad51ddeb0c4abf83f7468b4b3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote-ssh-run connects Unix, AIX, macOS, and Linux hosts to DSH over SSH. Its tools list hosts, probe status, and run allowlisted commands as argv arrays. Probes vary by host OS. Configure hosts and allowed commands in the DSH profile and provide local SSH credentials.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-3","index.js:22-32","index.js:56-67","index.js:90-103","lib/ssh.js:59-69"]}
